     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Support to the GoN in producing key policy document (13) such as LDC graduation strategy, Leave No One Behind national framework, national strategy of industrial sector to promote domestic production and consumption, national action plan against suicide, national human resource plan, provincial level climate change financing framework.

2.	Provided capacity building training on M&amp;E for more than 70 government officials, national account and macroeconomic perspectives for 49 GoN officials to enhance their understanding on these issues.

3.	Supported NPC in orienting SDG at sub-national levels- more than 1,700 officials trained on SDG aligned planning, SDG monitoring and its reporting. The events held across 7 provinces and 753 local governments

4. Supported to develop and roll out MTEF software for the provinces in order to improve the planning process aligned with the SDGs.</narrative>
      </comment>
